WEBVTT

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:07.980
Jin said to my face...

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:11.810
that I’m missing something...

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:17.990
And that’s why he
couldn’t go with me.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:24.800
Jin... may not like me,
not the way he used to...

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:27.390
That isn’t true!

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.010
Jin-Jin doesn’t hate
you at all, Rae-Rae.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:35.620
Even now, he loves you to pieces!

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:37.610
That’s what I, Ana, think.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.530
Who... are you?

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:18.990
Rae-Rae is a Feline Friend

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:21.490
Yeah?

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:26.120
So that’s what happened
while I was abroad

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:28.760
on my photo shoot for
my third photo album?

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:30.370
That’s right!

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:34.430
Thanks to Raetsel, every
day has been crazy!

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:34.730
DaiMORON, you should have your guard up!

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:37.650
In that case, I have a question for you.

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:37.650
Can you let it drop?
Don’t be such a prick!

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:41.730
What is that all about?

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:49.950
Here! Go, “Ah!”

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:53.860
Rae-Rae, you’re blushing!

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:55.900
I’m not blushing!

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:58.740
I’m begging you! Could
you please go away?

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:01.780
What is up with that girl?

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:04.790
I take it she wasn’t
our enemy after all?

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:07.220
Meh. Just leave her be.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:08.550
What?!

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:09.740
That’s what we’ve decided.

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:11.920
We aren’t going to have
anything more to do with her.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:15.920
We’re going to uncover the
truth about Jin without her.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:17.850
What’re you talking about?

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:18.920
That makes absolute no sense!

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:22.930
For one thing, she’s still oozing
with unanswered questions!

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:25.570
Aren’t you the least bit curious?

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:28.430
Well, sure I’m curious, but...

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:32.160
Oh, jeez! I’ll never get
anywhere if I try talking to you!

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:34.440
I’m going to take this up
with the person in question!

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:36.330
“Ah!”

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:37.940
Excuse me!

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.700
We need to talk.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.370
What? Let’s hear it.

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:55.680
Well, you see...

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:59.210
I’d like to hold a
welcoming party for you.

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:00.920
A welcoming party?

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:04.110
Right! Since you just transferred,

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:06.110
I bet you still don’t know your way around.

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:08.810
I’ll show you the ropes.

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:11.680
In exchange, could
share some information?

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:13.950
Like about yourself?

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:16.310
I, Ana, approve!

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.570
As do we!

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:21.370
Miss Elena, I am truly moved!

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:24.170
I had no idea that you were such a thoughtful,
caring person.

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:26.380
We’ve been worried since Miss Raetsel

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:28.080
hasn’t been her usual self lately.

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.880
Is something weighing down on you?

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.380
No, not really...

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.520
There is, isn’t there?!

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:37.080
What is it? What happened?

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:40.090
President, please figure
that out for yourself!

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:42.290
Isn’t there only one thing that

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:43.920
weighs heavy on a young lady’s heart?

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:46.930
It’s love! She’s love sick!

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:48.820
Well, actually...

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:51.680
You’re right. What was I thinking?

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:55.950
As the student council president,
I can’t turn a blind eye!

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:58.100
We should hold a welcoming
party as a way

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.820
to show Miss Raetsel our support!

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:01.540
Yeah!

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.830
We should all let down
our hair for the day!

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:07.120
Ele-Ele, let’s get going!

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:09.450
I-I guess I’m stuck going, too.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.790
In that case, I want all
of you to follow me!

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:14.680
Yay!

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:24.000
Raetsel, huh?

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:27.930
She may be another one
of Enigma’s pawns...

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:30.650
Do you think he’s using her?

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:35.160
Who the heck is that Enigma jerk?

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.440
His national rating as a
president is by no means low.

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:41.220
But apparently the Republic of Amgine

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.790
regulates information with an iron fist,

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:46.200
so the actual situation over there
is shrouded in darkness.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.550
In the end, he’s just
another mess of riddles, huh?

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:53.670
However, I was able to obtain one
piece of solid information.

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:55.830
Gammon.

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:57.300
Yeah?

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:59.170
Your bounty is now lower than mine.

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:01.310
What?!

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:03.340
You’re right.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:08.720
Cube’s is for $830,000 and
Gammon’s is now $640,000.

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:13.360
Why?! There is no way in hell
I’m worth less than Q-taro!

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:16.780
It’s because I just recently
defeated a Master Brain.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:21.080
Inversely, you haven’t solved a
puzzle by yourself in ages.

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:23.790
D-DaiMORON, you jerk!

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.040
What?! I only stated a fact!

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.110
Now, now.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:28.860
That’s just because no
one has gone after Gammon.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:30.960
Sheeit! I don’t like this.

00:06:31.340 --> 00:06:34.380
When ya get down to it, they’re
only interested in Kaito.

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:35.870
Hey, Gammon!

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:38.850
This $640,000 is heading out.

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:42.350
Gammon...

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:55.220
Miss Raetsel!

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.660
Hurry! Hurry up!

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:02.120
If there are any shops you’d like to check out,
just say the word.

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:04.200
You’re the star for the day!

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:08.420
Doesn’t window shopping together
make this feel like a girl’s day out?

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:09.670
But I, Ana, am a boy.

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:10.710
What?!

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:12.300
Oh, lookie!

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.750
Wouldn’t that look
great on Miss Raetsel?

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.170
Rae-Rae!

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:25.890
You should try it on.

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:27.730
Huh? But I...

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:29.920
Try it on, Miss Raetsel!

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:33.650
Yay! She’s trying it
on! She’s trying it on!

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:33.650
Isn’t that cute as well?

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:34.430
Yeah, it is cute.

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:43.030
1600--Target D.

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:45.490
Confirming the whereabouts
of the other three.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:50.940
Target B: Locked On!

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:58.950
This is a golden opportunity
to initiate Strategy #8377.

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:04.460
Complimentary Ticket to the Pool

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:11.690
You look wonderful, Miss Raetsel!

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:13.470
Not half bad.

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:34.290
Yay!

00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:58.260
Hey!

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:00.640
You should come in and join us!

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:07.150
Complimentary Ticket to the Pool

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.030
Rae-Rae, you’re very pretty.

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.030
What are you after?

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:18.170
Huh?

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:20.540
You’re plotting
something, aren’t you?

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:24.290
What do you plan on doing
after you get close to me?

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:28.060
Cats are my friend!

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.290
So you’re also a
feline friend, Rae-Rae!

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:32.940
I’m sick of your jokes!
What are you really--

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:38.930
Wh-what’re you doing?

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:42.720
Rae-Rae, you smell just like Kaito.

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:47.560
So I’d like you to have just as much

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:50.500
happy-smiley, fluffy-smiley as Kaito.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.730
That is how I, Ana, feel!

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:09.920
Were you the one who called me out here?

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:12.310
I’m glad you were man enough to come.

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:16.920
’Course I’d come!

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:21.680
It’s about time one of you Master Brains
realized I’m a great genius!

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:29.190
Listen! Nice men are more like landmines

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:32.190
than any other type, so be careful!

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:34.870
I see. Good to know!

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:36.070
Just what I’d expect from an idol!

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:39.340
No one gives advice quite like
someone rich with experience!

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:40.820
R-right...

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:42.570
Sheesh!

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:44.910
Now then, Miss Raetsel,

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:47.660
I’d like to turn the
spotlight onto you.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:50.290
You really love that cat
brooch, don’t you?

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:53.730
This...

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:02.800
By any chance, did it...?

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:06.810
It came from your special
someone, didn’t it?

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:11.780
This brooch represents... our bond.

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:17.320
Don’t give up, Miss Raetsel.

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:20.650
That’s right!

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:23.570
If you love him, you
shouldn’t give up!

00:11:23.960 --> 00:11:25.830
I’ll be here rooting for you!

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:28.080
Thank you.

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:30.590
Rae-Rae smiled!

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:34.590
Miss Raetsel, you have
a wonderful smile.

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:37.340
Really! It’s not like I was...

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:40.620
Kaito...

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:49.480
It looks like everyone is here.

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:53.770
This battle is as good as won!

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:09.750
I said that I don’t
know what’s going on!

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:11.500
Don’t play dumb!

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:16.630
If you didn’t call us here,
I’d like to know who in the world did!

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:21.370
It’s a trap!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:25.260
Target A: Kaito Daimon,

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:28.400
along with all of you other targets,

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:33.630
I am the greatest strategist
amongst the Master Brains,

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:35.270
Colonel Demolition Man!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:36.770
What?!

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:41.740
I am pleased to see that
you fell for my trap!

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:47.300
As of this moment, your fates rest in
the hands of this man, Target B!

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:49.240
Gammon?!

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:52.510
Punk! You never said
anything about this!

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:55.520
Have you taken everyone in
that building as hostages?!

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:57.510
I most certainly have.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:01.050
I am not giving you the
right to refuse to fight!

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:05.110
The moment this puzzle commences,
that tank will start moving.

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:07.750
Once it does, it will not stop until
you have freed the puzzle.

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:13.160
Target B, should you
fail to free the puzzle,

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:16.150
the tank will crash into that
building’s boiler room and...

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:23.420
You bastard...!

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:28.070
This is all for the great Jin Makata!

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:31.330
Now then, allow me to
explain the battle rules.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:34.640
This puzzle is called, “Tank Place.”

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:39.150
Once you’ve assigned each of the tanks a
tile on the onscreen field, you’re done.

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:45.010
However, the tanks cannot be lined up next to
each other horizontally or vertically.

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:48.020
What do the numbers on
the tanks represent?

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:51.350
That represents the main cannon’s
range for each individual tank.

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:55.400
You cannot place another
tank within its range.

00:13:56.240 --> 00:14:00.790
Furthermore, the cannon’s range
must not go out of bounds.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:04.500
There are a total of three missions.

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:06.880
So the numbers on the
tanks are my hints, huh?

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:09.210
This works out well.

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:13.420
It’s the perfect chance to give my
deteriorating bounty a major boost!

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:17.160
Now then, may the battle... commence!

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:37.870
What is going on here?

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:40.520
What is Enigma thinking...?

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:53.300
Is it immature to pick a college because
the person I love goes there?

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:57.890
Aw, I wish I could hurry up and
find my soul mate already!

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:00.350
Isn’t that Miss Itou...?

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:05.550
I should start by crossing out the
areas where I can’t put a tank.

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:08.050
That’s the right way
to tackle this puzzle.

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:13.520
But if I’m stuck solving this in my head,
it’s gonna be an insanely hard puzzle!

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:16.080
It’s passed Point 4.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:19.630
Code 10 and Code 604 are
proceeding smoothly.

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:25.690
What do you think of my strategy?

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:27.430
Starting with Kaito Daimon,

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:29.750
I gathered all of the important
targets into one area,

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:31.140
where I will annihilate
you in one fell swoop.

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:35.700
The one to trigger this chain of events shall
be their weakest ally, you, Target B.

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:39.660
That friggin’ hurt!

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:44.530
You only have a measly
$640,000 bounty on your head.

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:47.480
I’m taking minimal risk
to achieve maximal results!

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:50.660
This is one of my ingenious strategies!

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.480
That’s a load of crap!

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:55.160
I’m gonna make you
regret messin’ with me!

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:57.010
You’re gonna realize that you

00:15:57.010 --> 00:15:59.310
made the ultimate strategic
error when you chose me!

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:01.020
Boo-yah!

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:05.020
She left to find Upperclassman Kaito?

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:10.040
Miss Elena invited us over,
but apparently Kaito and the guys got lost.

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:12.380
After all, I beat them
here by a long shot...

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:13.440
Where is your swimsuit?

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.790
This one is giving him
a hard time, isn’t it?

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:23.580
Yeah. Solving it without making any
mistakes is practically impossible.

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:27.010
Galileo...

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:33.430
Oh, what’s this?

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.980
Where did all of your
fiery enthusiasm go?

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:39.700
Can’t solve a puzzle all by
your wee little self, Target B?

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:44.230
I should have figured as much from
one of Kaito Daimon’s flunkies!

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:46.900
Who’re you callin’ one
of Kaito’s flunkies?!

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:49.320
You think I can’t solve
a puzzle by myself?!

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.860
Keep your wise cracks to yourself!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.500
Got it!

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:58.380
Down to the last--What?!

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:01.830
The number of spaces just increased!

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:07.390
I never said that the field would
remain fixed at a constant size.

00:17:08.740 --> 00:17:10.840
Now what will you do, Target B?

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.170
With such precious
little time remaining,

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:17.850
can you solve the puzzle now that it
has grown even more difficult?

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:20.300
He won’t make it in time!

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:22.350
Hey, sit back and watch.

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:24.780
I know him all too well.

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:27.210
You can hit him with all you’ve got,

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:30.360
but he’ll stand strong, refusing to back down.

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:33.290
He can be a real pain!

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:40.280
My strategy has led me to victory!

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:42.930
You’re finished, Target B!

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:44.910
My name ain’t “Target B”!

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:46.120
What?!

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:49.700
I ain’t Kaito’s flunkey, either!

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:54.130
I am me, Gammon Sakanoue!

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:11.630
Impossible!

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.150
But you won’t finish in time.

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:16.530
I won’t stand for it!

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:19.660
You better believe I’m gonna make it!

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:22.410
I’m Galileo:

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:25.290
The Great Gammon Sakanoue!

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:46.310
Sweet!

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:47.410
Yay! Gammon did it!

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:49.030
You really can be a pain in the butt.
Yay! Gammon did it!

00:18:49.030 --> 00:18:50.060
Enigma...!

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:55.440
Preposterous! He defeated
my glorious strategy?!

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:58.310
N-now that it has come to this...

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:02.000
I’d better retreat!

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:06.340
Strategic retreat!

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:13.100
Gammon...

00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:16.350
You took forever, dummy!

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:18.520
I owe ya one, Gammon.

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:21.070
It’s not like I did it for you.

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:25.400
I’ll CRUSH anyone stupid
enough to pick a fight with me!

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:28.610
Always have, and I always will!

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:32.240
Kaito!

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:34.900
Guys, over here!

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:37.670
Huh? Where is Miss Raetsel?

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:38.970
Come to think of it...

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:41.290
Huh? She’s gone...

00:19:41.710 --> 00:19:43.280
Where’d she wander off to?

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:44.550
Raetsel!

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:45.840
Miss Raetsel!
Raetsel!

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:47.550
I wonder where she went...

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:53.050
Thank goodness!

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:54.850
I’m glad to see you
made it back alive.

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:59.420
I am truly happy to see
that you are all right.

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:02.770
Stop it! That sounds so fakey!

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:04.910
I nearly got killed!

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:08.310
I would have been willing
to accept your death.

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:13.700
If that were to happen, I
felt it was meant to be.

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:18.570
After all, you have begun to doubt Jin.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:22.080
Falling for Kaito Daimon
and his friends’ lies,

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:24.230
you were on the verge of believing

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:27.020
their nonsense that Jin
actually LOVED puzzles.

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:31.020
No matter how special you are,

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:34.960
I simply cannot tolerate such betrayal.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:41.400
As such, I let the Fates cast
their judgment in his stead.

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:44.970
I’ve never doubted
Jin... Not even once.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:48.850
I will fulfill my contract.

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:51.100
Raetsel!

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:55.600
I am glad to hear it!

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.790
Now our misunderstanding
has been cleared up!

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.170
I’ve put you through a horrible
experience, haven’t I?

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.750
Just as you’ve helped us in the past,

00:21:04.620 --> 00:21:06.690
please continue to offer your full support.

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:10.880
Everything we do is
for our Jin Makata...

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:24.420
Rae-Rae!

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:27.440
What happened? You left
in the middle of our--

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:28.610
Stay away from me!

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:33.140
I’ve heard about you, Elena Himekawa.

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:36.250
You were one of Kaito’s
friends, weren’t you?

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:40.750
Listen up! I’m your enemy!

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:45.150
I will annihilate Kaito Daimon and
all of the puzzlers in the world!

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:48.850
If it’s for Jin, I’ll
use any means necessary.

00:21:52.340 --> 00:21:55.550
Thank you. I had a good time yesterday.

00:22:01.640 --> 00:22:04.580
That smell... It’s gone.

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:16.540
As it worked out, I managed to
punish the kitten this time.

00:22:17.490 --> 00:22:21.260
But kittens tend to act
out of a passing whim.

00:22:23.620 --> 00:22:26.610
She truly is a hopeless stray.

00:22:27.210 --> 00:22:29.170
Isn’t that right, Mister?

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:05.980
Hurry, Freecell! You’ll be late for
your test if you miss this train.

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:07.770
You certainly can be a worrywart.

00:24:07.770 --> 00:24:10.520
But we are cutting it--Oh,
I forgot my rail pass.

00:24:10.520 --> 00:24:12.050
Hurry and buy a ticket!

00:24:12.050 --> 00:24:13.050
I forgot my wallet, too.

00:24:13.050 --> 00:24:14.190
Then use mine!

00:24:14.190 --> 00:24:15.820
Your wallet is completely empty.

00:24:15.820 --> 00:24:18.150
Someone, please help us!

00:24:18.320 --> 00:24:20.320
Next time, “Would You
Also Like Some Flowers?”

00:24:18.950 --> 00:24:27.980
Would You Also Like Some Flowers?

00:24:20.740 --> 00:24:23.490
There is no need to panic.
The train has already left.

00:24:23.490 --> 00:24:24.410
Checkmate!

00:24:24.410 --> 00:24:25.620
We get to repeat the year...

00:24:27.980 --> 00:24:30.990
Art: Akeru Otsuki
